TDD fix iteration (round 2):
- Replaced soft t.Logf reconnect assertion with hard check: second SSE connect MUST carry Last-Event-ID=evt-1.
- Added TestControlHTTPClientSyncPollingFallback: 3 SSE 503s then success, polling ticker must fire >= 3 snapshots during the down window.
- Added TestControlHTTPClientSyncMonotonic: stale snapshots must NEVER trigger apply; rev=10 pre-seed must survive.
- Restructured Sync: polling runs on a dedicated goroutine independent of SSE state; SSE reconnect uses bounded exponential backoff with jitter (default 100ms..30s, configurable via MinBackoff/MaxBackoff/Jitter).
- SSE event IDs recorded on every successful delivery via recordEventID; replayed on reconnect via Last-Event-ID header.
- SSE parser: per-test ParseReader helper to avoid io.Reader interface dispatch.

